 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_op_reach_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_op_reach_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Lume Reach. A settlement, a Well, and a neighbor that answers when addressed. Three reasons to walk carefully, and we have business with all three.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 187,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_op_reach_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_op_liaison_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_op_liaison_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_mara_vey",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "operations_radio",
   "source_text": "Meridian units in your area are quarantine posture, not policy. I am off-map and staying there. What you commit at that Well is committed under Kharuun authority.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 202,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_op_liaison_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_op_liability_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_op_liability_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "We also carry a debt: the district your allocation deferred still has a liability standing. We resolve it before we touch the Well. Order matters.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 186,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_op_liability_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_op_choice_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_op_choice_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "And when the Well offers its three futures, the choice will be ours alone. My accounts are already arguing. Good. That is what they are for.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 180,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_op_choice_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_contact_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_contact_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_contact_established",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Contact established on the approach. The presence acknowledged us — not warmly, not coldly. Precisely.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 142,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_contact_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_contact_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_contact_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_mara_vey",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_contact_established",
   "delivery_channel": "operations_radio",
   "source_text": "Logged from off-map: contact is yours, attribution is yours. The Compact record will say exactly that and nothing more.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 159,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_contact_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_liability_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_liability_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_liability_resolved",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Waystone stands at the deferred district's liability. What the allocation left dark now has an anchor in it. Not power. An anchor. It is a start.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 189,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_liability_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_liability_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_liability_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_liability_resolved",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Now the anchors, in sequence. The Reach listens best through two spines, and we intend to be heard accurately.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 150,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_liability_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_anchor1_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_anchor1_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_first_anchor_raised",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "First anchor is up. The strata under Lume Reach carry old resonance — the settlement hums back.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 135,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_anchor1_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_anchor2_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_anchor2_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_second_anchor_raised",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Second anchor holds. The pair is tuned, and the Well is within reach of an honest signal.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 129,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_anchor2_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_anchor2_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_anchor2_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_second_anchor_raised",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Well offers three protocols. Read all three before anyone touches anything. We commit once.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 135,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_anchor2_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_harvest_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_harvest_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_protocol_committed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Harvest, then. Draw the Reach's held futures as yield, and let the settlement spend what it can no longer keep.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 151,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_harvest_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_harvest_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_harvest_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_protocol_committed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The resolution site is south and ashward. We finish what we committed, publicly, where the Reach can watch.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 147,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_harvest_b",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_preserve_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_preserve_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_protocol_committed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Preserve. The Reach's futures stay held, unspent, and the Well keeps its weight. Some debts are best left uncollected.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 158,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m10_vo_preserve_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m10_line_preserve_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m10_line_preserve_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m10_evt_protocol_committed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The resolution stands at the held vault's public site. We go and close it properly.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 123,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
